*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  verification of 5GC002255-C feature in the case of FDD+TDD Classical Fullstack SA
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Reach a cell setup state, and perfom basic tests :
...                       Ue Register ...
